Depends: perl (>= 5.36),
         homelab-common,
         libmojolicious-perl,
         libyaml-libyaml-perl,
         libmojo-pg-perl,
         adduser
Recommends: homelab-database, homelab-pgbouncer, homelab-api
Description: File storage web UI for the homelab-* ecosystem
 A BFF-style Mojolicious app: browsers talk only to this app, which
 proxies login through to homelab-api (Homelab::Common::AuthClient) and
 holds the resulting token in its own session cookie. Upload/list/
 download/delete files, stored on local disk under
 /var/lib/homelab/drive-storage, indexed in its own `drive` Postgres
 schema (split runtime/migrate roles, see CLAUDE.md). Registers itself
 in homelab-api's service registry on startup.
